        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"73\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\")"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "External UART3 lines are shorted to MCU VCAP nodes, corrupting UART3 operation and likely preventing proper MCU regulator decoupling; this can damage or destabilize the MCU.",
      "confidence": 0.93
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The netlist shows severe power and connectivity deviations from the specified Hades design: the MCU 3V3 rail is not sourced and MCU VDD/VSS connections are missing, while FCC1 VCAP pins are also bridged to UART3 nets. These faults would make the board nonfunctional and are not documented as known limitations."
}

